                    "type": "header",
                    "content": "Introduction",
                    "level": 2,
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 10
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Across two summers I worked with a post-graduate at NC State who was researching a plant sensor material. His focus was primarily material science, however, my involvement was main revolved around the electronics and software. The goal of the project was to develop a \"digital twin interface\" for viewing plant stimuli. This involved building the electronics and programming the backend/frontend.",
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 10
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "header",
                    "content": "Contents",
                    "size": 2,
                    "level": 3,
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 15
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "The project has been broken into these main sections:",
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 5
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
