            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section",
            "positioning": {
                "marginTop": 20
            },
            "elements": [
                {
                    "type": "header",
                    "content": "The Design",
                    "id": "design",
                    "level": 2
                },
                {
                    "type": "grid",
                    "align": "start",
                    "positioning": {
                        "marginTop": 10
                    },
                    "elements": [
                        {
                            "type": "container",
                            "positioning": {
                                "marginTop": 0
                            },
                            "elements": [
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 0
                                    },
                                    "content": "The overall design of the project can be broken into 8 parts. These eight parts will be grouped together and explained in more depth, but this will give a general overview of purpose:"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**1. Plant Stimulus** - Stimuli, mainly touching the plant, are detected through two electrodes on the stem of the plant. The exact material and design of the electrodes was the research's focus."
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**2. Amplify + Digitize** - An amplifier and an Analog-to-Digital Converter are used together to amplify the tiny milivolt signals from the plant into digital numeric values."
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**3. Initial Data Processing** - An arduino receives the data and outputs a JSON string over Serial (UART)"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**4. ESP32 Sender** - An ESP32 sends the JSON strings wireless over ESP-NOW to a receier ESP32."
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**5. ESP32 Receiver** - An ESP32 receives the data and sends it to the backend over Serial"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**6. Backend** - A backend running on any PC serves the data to the frontend and saves it to a database"
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**7a. Frontend Interface** - The \"digital twin\" interface that shows plant stimuli on a web UI."
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "text",
                                    "positioning": {
                                        "marginTop": 10
                                    },
                                    "content": "**7b. Database** - The database stores the most recent data, as well as persistent values like thresholds."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
